  Description: Your tongue is especially long, and you can launch it with extraordinary
    range and precision. You can use your tongue to deliver spells with a range of
    touch and perform extremely simple Interact actions, such as opening some types
    of unlocked doors. Your tongue can't perform actions that require fingers or
    significant manual dexterity, including any action that would require a check
    to accomplish, and you can't use it to hold items.
